  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Short-Term Low Volume Sea Water Desalination Plant for the Southern Governorates of the Gaza strip - Phase II (STLV-II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Key object is to ensure the quality of water provided to consumers meet minimum WHO guidelines and to ensure consumers have access to at least 90 l/c/d of safe water for drinking and domestic purposes. The overarching objective is to arrest the rapid deterioration of the fresh water resources in the coastal aquifer and to mitigate a potential environmental catastrophe.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
